                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN UND VORRICHTUNGEN FÜR AUFWECKSIGNALDESIGN UND RESSOURCENZUWEISUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">TECHNIQUES ET APPAREILS DE CONCEPTION DE SIGNAL DE RÉVEIL ET D'ATTRIBUTION DE RESSOURCES</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">TECHNIQUES AND APPARATUSES FOR WAKEUP SIGNAL DESIGN AND RESOURCE ALLOCATION</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method, an apparatus, a base station, a user equipment, and a computer program product for wireless communication are provided. The base station may configure resource allocation for wakeup signaling based at least in part on one or more resource patterns corresponding to different user equipment groups and/or antenna port configurations. The user equipment may receive a wakeup signal based at least in part on the resource allocation, detect the wakeup signal based at least in part on a preamble of the wakeup signal, and receive a subsequent communication based at least in part on the wakeup signal. Numerous other aspects are provided.</p>
            </abstract>
